    "text": "A solid AB has NaCl type structure with edge length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>580</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>.</mo></math> The radius of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>.</mo></math> What is the radius of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> in pm?",
