  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> has fcc structure and thus,<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>580</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>290</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>290</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />So <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>290</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>190</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
